pe": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "列式：8 倍 = 2 的 3 次方。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "推导：因为 翻 n 番 = 2^n 倍，所以 n = 3。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "结论：翻了 3 番。"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "五、易错点纠偏"}]}, {"type": "highlightBlock", "attrs": {"backgroundColor": "#fef2f2", "borderColor": "#ef4444", "icon": "⚠️"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "⚠️ 几何级数的直觉陷阱：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "看到 8 倍，很多考生因为紧张，大脑第一反应是“翻 4 番”（以为 2×4=8）或者“翻 8 番”。记住！番数是指数运算，不是乘除法！"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "六、刷题建议"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "拿张纸，默写 2 的 1 到 10 次方表（2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, 128, 256, 512, 1024）。在材料里看到任何 2 的倍数，立马反应出对应的番数。"}]}]}$$ AS jsonb), NULL, '成数与番数的核心考点与速算。', category_node.id, CAST('["资料分析", "成数与番数"]' AS jsonb), FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, NOW(), 0, 0, CAST('{"content_type": "knowledge_point", "category_code": "kp_xingce_data_term_chengshu_fanshu", "source": "fba_content_engine"}' AS jsonb), 1, NOW()
